raylib
  Copyright (c) 2013-2026 Ramon Santamaria (@raysan5)
  https://github.com/raysan5/raylib
  Licensed under the zlib/libpng license (the same license as above).

  This project does not vendor or redistribute raylib itself: it loads the
  system-installed libraylib shared library at runtime over its C ABI.

  Many examples in src/net/b12n/raylib_jlt/ are Clojure ports of raylib's
  own example programs. The README's example table names the upstream
  source for each (e.g. core/core_basic_window, shapes/shapes_bouncing_ball).
  Those examples are likewise zlib/libpng licensed, and this project is
  released under the same license so that the original terms carry through.
